{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は14thシングルのアンダー曲の\n振り入れをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/06/5257550/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り入れは中田の大の苦手で\n本当に遅いんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は全然 辛くなくて\nむしろ「花奈、今回の振り入れ早かったね」と言われるほどでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14thシングル制作の\nいいスタートがきれたように思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/06/5257550/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんぜ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/06/5257550/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前発売してた生写真の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FNS歌謡祭の衣装かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真撮影で初めて着たけど\nこの衣装可愛くて好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/06/5257550/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルースタードーナツが\n梅田に明日まで期間限定で出店してるらしいから\nその記念で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/06/5257550/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抹茶ケーキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ申し訳ないことに\nこれは今は売ってないと思います..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612